# Phase 11 PR11-6: generated OpenAPI client SDKs +
# the spec snapshot. Regenerated by scripts/gen-clients.sh
# from the current admin surface; committing the megabytes
# of typed Rust/TS/Python on every spec change would flood
# diffs without adding review signal. The release workflow
# regenerates from the spec at build time and publishes
# to npm / PyPI / crates.io.
/openapi.json
/clients/

# Python bytecode from the boot-smoke fixture scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
